					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							1596.409,
							245.721,
							-1593.495
						],
						"pointId": 15598
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							1612.496,
							249.147,
							-1612.986
						],
						"pointId": 15599
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							1607.029,
							246.406,
							-1601.496
						],
						"pointId": 15600
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 700740901,
					"content": "Unbelievable... Since when were hilichurls so amenable to reason?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740902,
					"content": "Ella! You haven't seen Varka around here, have you!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740903,
					"content": "As a matter of fact, yes I have. Just now, he went off to borrow a \"large cauldron\" from the hilichurls... and get this — they gave it up as soon as they saw him!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740904,
					"content": "The weirdest thing was, they barely exchanged any words at all. I just don't understand how it all went so smoothly... Could the Grand Master know some hilichurl body language that I'm unaware of?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740905,
						700740906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740905,
					"content": "I don't think that was \"communication\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740907
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740907,
					"content": "Ugh, that's not the point here! Anyway, where is he now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740908,
					"content": "Right over there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ella Musk"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740909,
					"content": "Finally, it's done! The finest wine in all of Teyvat... Right here, in my hands!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740910,
					"content": "Varka! Don't—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740911
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740911,
					"content": "Oh, hey gang — you finally made it! Those hilichurls just now were surprisingly reasonable... Didn't expect this to go half so smoothly, hah.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740912,
					"content": "Anyway, time to find out what this bad boy tastes like!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740913,
					"content": "...Wait, don't drink it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740914
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740914,
					"content": "Huh? You wanna taste it first? Hehe, dream on, kid... The honor of the first cup's mine!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740915,
					"content": "That's not what I'm—",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740916
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740916,
					"content": "Don't worry! I'll leave some for ya!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740917,
					"content": "*chug* *chug* Ahhh... Hrrgh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740918,
					"content": "Hold up... Why do I feel... so bad...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740919
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740919,
					"content": "Varka! Are you okay? Varka? Varkaaa!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740920,
						700740921
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740920,
					"content": "Grand Master!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740922
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740922,
					"content": "Come on! You didn't defeat a god just to bite the dust here!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740923
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740923,
					"content": "Ugh... Agh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740924
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740924,
					"content": "...For a moment there, I could've sworn I saw all the previous Knights of Boreas standing right here in front of me...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740925,
						700740926
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740925,
					"content": "I don't know if I should chew you out for ending up like this...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740927
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740927,
					"content": "Either way, I need a moment to digest it all... both the drink, and the lesson too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740928
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740928,
					"content": "You give Varka the rundown on Diona's infallible knack for mixing drinks.\\n\"In other words,\" you tell him, \"only she could turn such strange ingredients into top-rate liquor...\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740929
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740929,
					"content": "Aha, so the missing ingredient was actually the spring fairy's blessing... Haha, never would've guessed!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740930
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740930,
					"content": "Hey, don't you act all innocent! You still owe us one for trying to pull the wool over our eyes!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740931
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740931,
					"content": "Sorry, sorry... Truth is, though, I genuinely believed it would work — and I was even planning to come clean over a drink or two afterwards, anyway...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740932
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740932,
					"content": "But I guess... you probably don't wanna drink it anymore, do you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740933,
						700740934
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740933,
					"content": "I think... I'll pass.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740935
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740935,
					"content": "Hmm... Well, guess I owe you one! How about this — I'll treat you to a meal at the Good Hunter once we're back.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740936
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740936,
					"content": "Now that's more like it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740937
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740937,
					"content": "You're way too easy to bribe...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740938
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740938,
					"content": "Oh, c'mon! You saw what a state he was in after he downed that cup. Paimon's sure he's learned his lesson!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740939
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740939,
					"content": "*sigh* Guess I have no one to blame but myself, huh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740940,
						700740941
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740940,
					"content": "Aaaanyway... Back to the subject of your \"task.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740942
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740942,
					"content": "Haha, well... I was gonna save that story for the tavern, but I guess the open air will have to do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740943
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740943,
					"content": "...So you're giving \"tasks\" to everyone in Mondstadt, huh? Interesting idea... Do I get one, too?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740944
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varka"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740944,
					"content": "Hah! Well, if you really must know, yours was to \"change the fate reflected in the scryglass.\" But you already did that quite some time ago — the moment you decided to set off on your expedition, to be precise.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Alice"
				},
				{
					"id": 700740941,
					"content": "Why is it blank?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740942
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740934,
					"content": "Not sure if I've got that kinda courage.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740935
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740926,
					"content": "Or marvel that you're still standing at all...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740927
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740921,
					"content": "C'mon dude, get a hold of yourself!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740922
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700740906,
					"content": "At least, not in any recognizable language — body or otherwise...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700740907
					]
				}
			]
		},
